## 1. Summary

App: Blue Basket: A company app for our employees and field staff: checklists, attendance and approvals. Audience: Employees and their managers. 22 screens in 9 journeys. Journeys: Pick up a task and finish its checklist, Sign in, Fill in a form, Send a request, Approve or reject a request, Log time worked. Roles: Employee, Manager. Look: Corporate and calm. Mocked.

- Who uses it: Employees and their managers.
- It has 22 screens in 9 journeys: Pick up a task and finish its checklist, Sign in, Fill in a form, Send a request, Approve or reject a request, Log time worked and 3 more.
- The look is corporate and calm with a bottom-tabs navigation.
- Mocked for now: Company single sign-on, HR system, File storage, Company single sign-on, Send codes and reminders from the server.
- Assumed instead of asked: Light or dark, Where the data comes from, Offline, Notifications, Language, Accessibility and 4 more.
- Added from research: Offline use for field staff, Company announcements, Company single sign-on, Role-based views, Ask for consent before collecting sensitive data, Send codes and reminders from the server.

## 2. App

```yaml id=APP kind=app
name: Blue Basket
purpose: 'A company app for our employees and field staff: checklists, attendance and approvals'
audience: Employees and their managers
tone: professional
```

