## 11. Flows

### FLW-001 - Pick up a task and finish its checklist

```yaml id=FLW-001 kind=flow
name: Pick up a task and finish its checklist
primary: true
screens: [SCR-002, SCR-008, SCR-009, SCR-013, SCR-014]
start: SCR-002
end: SCR-014
purpose: The main journey for field staff, from the day's list to a signed-off checklist.
```

### FLW-002 - Sign in

```yaml id=FLW-002 kind=flow
name: Sign in
screens: [SCR-001, SCR-002]
start: SCR-001
end: SCR-002
```

### FLW-003 - Fill in a form

```yaml id=FLW-003 kind=flow
name: Fill in a form
screens: [SCR-011, SCR-012, SCR-014]
start: SCR-011
end: SCR-014
```

### FLW-004 - Send a request

```yaml id=FLW-004 kind=flow
name: Send a request
screens: [SCR-019, SCR-020]
start: SCR-019
end: SCR-020
```

### FLW-005 - Approve or reject a request

```yaml id=FLW-005 kind=flow
name: Approve or reject a request
screens: [SCR-016, SCR-017]
start: SCR-016
end: SCR-017
```

### FLW-006 - Log time worked

```yaml id=FLW-006 kind=flow
